# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Health Hub — environment variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Frontend (VITE_ prefix = exposed to browser bundle) ──────────────────────
# Base path for all API calls. In dev, Vite proxies this to the VPS.
# In production (Cloudflare Pages), this is handled by Pages Functions.
VITE_API_BASE=/api

# Simple API auth token sent as X-Health-Key header.
# Must match the key your VPS FastAPI server expects.
VITE_API_KEY=brody-health-hub-2026

# ── Server-side only (NO VITE_ prefix = never exposed to browser) ─────────────
# Used by:
#   • Vite local-dev middleware (vite.config.ts) for POST /api/ai/analyze-food
#   • Cloudflare Pages Functions for receipt scanning + food photo analysis
#
# LOCAL DEV: Add your key here, it stays server-side (Vite never bundles it).
# PRODUCTION: Set this in Cloudflare Pages → Settings → Environment Variables.
#             Name: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY  |  Value: sk-ant-api03-...
#
# Get your key at: https://console.anthropic.com
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api03-your-key-here

# ── Production Cloudflare Pages env vars (set in dashboard, not here) ─────────
# HEALTH_API_KEY   — same value as VITE_API_KEY above (used server-side in CF Functions)
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY — same key as above (enables AI features in production)
